g A New Allegation Of Paying For An Abortion Of A GOP Senate Candidate Is Responding Tonight}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK \\l "toc61"}}{\fldrslt{\fs20\cf2\par\bullet\tab \uc2 The Fallout From A High Stakes Showdown In Pennsylvania With Control Of Congress Hanging In The Ballots}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK \\l "toc62"}}{\fldrslt{\fs20\cf2\par\bullet\tab \uc2 Democrat John Fetterman And Republican Dr. Mehmet Oz Face Off}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK \\l "toc63"}}{\fldrslt{\fs20\cf2\par\bullet\tab \uc2 NBC NIGHTLY NEWS for October 26, 2022, NBC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK \\l "toc64"}}{\fldrslt{\fs20\cf2\par\bullet\tab \uc2 The Today Show for October 26, 2022, NBC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK \\l "toc65"}}{\fldrslt{\fs20\cf2\par\bullet\tab \uc2 The Today Show for October 26, 2022, NBC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK \\l "toc66"}}{\fldrslt{\fs20\cf2\par\bullet\tab \uc2 Missed Cases Of Breast Cancer: The Detection Delayed In Dozens Of Patients And The Hospital At The Center Of The Controversy}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK \\l "toc67"}}{\fldrslt{\fs20\cf2\par\bullet\tab \uc2 NBC NIGHTLY NEWS for October 25, 2022, NBC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK \\l "toc68"}}{\fldrslt{\fs20\cf2\par\bullet\tab \uc2 Meet the Press for October 23, 2022, NBC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK \\l "toc69"}}{\fldrslt{\fs20\cf2\par\bullet\tab \uc2 Today for October 20, 2022, NBC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK \\l "toc70"}}{\fldrslt{\fs20\cf2\par\bullet\tab \uc2 The New Pledge From President Biden, If Democrats Keep Control Of Congress, He`ll Immediately Move To Pass National Abortion Rights}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK \\l "toc71"}}{\fldrslt{\fs20\cf2\par\bullet\tab \uc2 NBC NIGHTLY NEWS for October 18, 2022, NBC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK \\l "toc72"}}{\fldrslt{\fs20\cf2\par\bullet\tab \uc2 TODAY for October 18, 2022, NBC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK \\l "toc73"}}{\fldrslt{\fs20\cf2\par\bullet\tab \uc2 Conversation With Elizabeth Heiskell About Her Breast Cancer Journey}}}{\fie